OL,3,AAlexander brothers each sentenced to 30
OL,4,Ayears in prison in sex trafficking case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree brothers - two of them wealthy
OL,7,Freal-estate moguls - were sentenced to
OL,8,F30 years each in prison for drugging
OL,9,Fand raping dozens of women over
OL,10,Fdecades.
OL,12,FTal Alexander, 40, and twins Oren and
OL,13,FAlon Alexander, 39, were found guilty
OL,14,Fin March of using their wealth and
OL,15,Fsocial status to lure women to parties
OL,16,Fand luxury homes, where they sexually
OL,17,Fassaulted them.
OL,19,F"Your conduct was monstrous," said
OL,20,FJudge Valerie Caproni before sentencing
OL,21,Fthem. "Your crimes wreaked havoc on
OL,22,Ftheir lives."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
